      <h1>Baugenehmigung Terrassenüberdachung – wann nötig?</h1>
      <p class="article-meta"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" style="width:14px;height:14px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:5px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg>2 Min. Lesezeit · BV AussenSysteme</p>
